## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Timeline-as-home Phases 1–4** — tsc·0 / vitest 1088 / replay-pilot 30/30 on every commit (9a5cd93, 89ddf2b, 2f2c235, 6cc4e58).
- **Variant-select (promote generation_history attempt)** — commit 537c013 + root-cause fix 637f6c3; Director confirmed SH15 switches after the byte-reachability fix.
- **Media-unreachable ROOT CAUSE found + fixed** — verified: all 4 byte-dead refs (SH08/15/22/28) were EXACTLY the shots with a `director_edit` in generation_history (= the ones the Director variant-selected); no un-selected ref was dead. Fix 637f6c3 + out-of-band data patch (copied attempt bytes → canonical `-v01-APPROVED.png`; confirmed files on disk).
- **Plan-aware Generate-video button** — 3d29b73, tsc·0/vitest 1088. Renders (EXEC-VGEN) if an APPROVED plan exists, else runs Video Designer.
- **Goal 1 root cause CONFIRMED** — `/auto-react` route (Polina's Mode-3 autonomous path) NEVER applied `conciergeReasoningParam()` (the anthropic reasoning cap that /chat + /chat-internal have). On claude-opus-4-8 → uncapped extended thinking billed at output rate. budget_log (agent EXEC-CONC): 155 calls, $35 total, spike **$14.41 in one hour** (2026-07-01T17:00) — consistent with uncapped-Opus auto-react.
- **E13 is `pipeline_mode='parallel'`** — flipped via DB, verified.
- **Polina switched to Gemini free** — `.env.local` CONCIERGE_PROVIDER anthropic→gemini. IMPORTANT: only the Next dev server runs the concierge (routes concierge/auto-react + chat); the Inngest worker does NOT — so video jobs are safe; Next auto-reloads on .env change.

